    {
      "id": "61aa1196-3dcb-43ad-b6ea-aba2d1a9d6f4",
      "title": "Leia a comparação e note o que cada palavra ajuda a localizar.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "519e52d3-f8f2-4959-84d6-cc36bc63c5f4",
          "textContent": "<p><strong>Vacante</strong> fala da abertura.</p><p><strong>Puesto</strong> fala da função ou do cargo dentro da empresa.</p><p>Num anúncio breve, as duas ideias podem aparecer juntas: <strong>vacante de soporte</strong> e <strong>puesto de agente de soporte</strong>.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "19fef682-af63-411f-871d-bd34d0fb2c1f",
      "title": "Observe a cena, escute a expressão e ligue o espanhol ao sentido em português.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 3,
      "sequenceItem": 5,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "82cc0f13-4055-441b-a365-b2c241063e5d",
          "textContent": "<p>Outra palavra central para ler anúncios curtos.</p><p><strong>un requisito</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>um requisito</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/f388092d88e64580b9843545f1f2e2c8_l02b05-requirements-context.png?Expires=1794099644&Signature=ZGMzGRtoZVidpTT6nYixgMS1WW91xbbpLXjpUPx5XayMQyNBm-MjLXa90QFaz5x28Hvn6DBfvJmIyrWsDYa0L2iCv-WaPP4Cd7kQ1cOKyyjOZO0RROQsT9~XxhnGfVRHGVbAjTtmpKGJc6luVGThzDQ9rNLrb5rd9HKL0tUWM-0RkZJE049toSvtapcmUuZLTdjIfTEoi-RvqqdAQ~FQ2fDPW17pVCp5bP-ATxUnlzIfoW~0hHWJ-PHw3R3A~HXt61dAditksKJvGRb97vQ5DSUpI9rWjsl2A09PN7CP3FOPN24xdH9eQfzhO9yPVq7AdyZEIIj1hroSLyfdoxPuIw__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
