    {
      "id": "78d237dd-1843-4006-85a4-e83c60c89a7b",
      "title": "Leia o microanúncio e observe onde aparece cada informação principal.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 1,
      "sequenceItem": 6,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "3c136d0e-e336-46b9-9df2-7a709c14e8c6",
          "textContent": "<p>Veja como as três palavras entram num anúncio breve.</p><p><strong>Vacante:</strong> soporte</p><p><strong>Puesto:</strong> agente de soporte</p><p><strong>Requisito:</strong> experiencia con clientes</p><p>Essas três linhas já dizem o que está aberto, qual função aparece e o que a empresa pede.</p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": null
        }
      ],
      "dialogue_bubbles": null,
      "glossary": null
    },
    {
      "id": "b4c276af-21af-4da6-ab6b-5922b4aa7b8f",
      "title": "Lendo uma vaga juntos",
      "description": "<p>As palavras-chave aparecem agora dentro de uma conversa curta sobre uma oportunidade realista.</p>",
      "contentType": 7,
      "sequenceItem": 7,
      "items": [],
      "dialogue_bubbles": [
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Vi una vacante de soporte para una empresa pequeña.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Vi uma vaga de suporte para uma empresa pequena.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/7cf35219c6a44f4f88db75705604cb1a_l02b07-lucia-vi-una-vacante.mp3?Expires=1794099644&Signature=gOzvI2eirLpLG59mvfndJXT1WrW3Sk5mjEuFkAo6z8c~TU9uZeuAUO9ouBARxc~Ef5MuSbAN-tofTA69yXA7MIQidOQhEbuh-eTmxcEM1K55sBIVNGtHxeOxSufNnS~EfKOGYg~UXHjQ~wZ3KCcL-ZZtudP9TFyUmBSOvHKDkxtQLYEHPw7IcaRwodaHQXj48pDagXIo0ODxbZULQ3YspyvFw7Gdr5FNYRLLU0p1mUVzD1ngBWD5O~9eSA9ocMR-YGU5InjTlXqr1iKxgfLbD1JRdGTcwKZbA7T6BTyCbqCcPK~HpdLyBrh3vjqUpesLg6UNdSd5OoRbemhQhGajOA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">¿El puesto es remoto o híbrido?</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">O cargo é remoto ou híbrido?</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/14643a94cc954b199dcadebcae0f32af_l02b07-diego-el-puesto-es-remoto-o-hibrido.mp3?Expires=1794099644&Signature=2WnW9nVIYDtdQL99mRhqAV~kVMRs0TrnnRaBcp4XqU0Q080MWDvGvSlG9nCHzp~mOu5665tpCr7INXDtNawrSUxUIA5uoqAxXDvg0QNLVDUUB39oKE1gQGnyrXiBeXo77Y2R1SgOT6xdwxlZ6YMWdRBOzrSLm-ym3~~Nxk3YHjLdGlwwfdY96K0Zs17nv95UrMkmombMAFomotObgrQC8hVy4bdzqe2BYmalculGs1mMTnHKM4aUxmQslAvVgEK~cGJQkD~0WkU300Sj8IAh5psl9O7g-E8jqoTvZ4GENHkp8Dst3LcU~WiEVSK7~u6xKeXYdTgKPJrAVugWtHp3mA__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Es híbrido, y piden experiencia con clientes.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">É híbrido, e pedem experiência com clientes.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/408e79c1cbc64101855f7eb735ee774a_l02b07-lucia-es-hibrido.mp3?Expires=1794099644&Signature=zUcgphyQeWNyM3CBhVQktsZn7TAJdNoPRFglM2JGCdFfhVGFDBTcOh9UUvY2Czw5oMNMPuErxsPs8dhtTJlp4d1igg4hA8ngw6Ecnx8o2eBZnd9XeoD9pa~cGizfRSqsuITUxXBlBWwORiI~Bns59y1j9cI8-eQX2Bkx7DRKzrLf-gPLXIal9Q-Li0zn-CufI3HGYFGoWIyirh5dQyZQfEndCL~olg~lKmxgHSRoZueSWZLlBnfka-9-H1WlJMwox~u8oq-KIIKddKrqKMyq5Oyz-leJS3iYtvXSKx2Qc5bCZkuWqaIJqhrEQ9~HSkufG7zEIW147gu8eHowmUy5JQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
          "translation": null
        },
        {
          "text": "<div>\n  <div style=\"font-weight: 700;\">Entonces ya entiendo lo que buscan.</div>\n  <div style=\"opacity: 0.45;\">Então já entendo o que estão buscando.</div>\n</div>",
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/aedc4a6bde694699a86bd77809325018_l02b07-diego-entiendo-lo-que-buscan.mp3?Expires=1794099644&Signature=iBBZ2tsgUd~sc8MmD~IwwcJ7ot0bgCUrfe3j2aEDBDdTNsGcAwOOIhIvsh0BwmnCfC0AZ1OkpxqIxX6PlVfWGtVsqhCuQzuB7-oW918QXA7r6iR2Ut3JL9ZVOsQFlqjDl31RqsdiWTEWKu0L~FCWgIm3e3jrbjGkbiuDE2m2~0DE0YXLVOTMMJZhcI9V6BNUEtpp98~Mmr92ycuU9SUUkyrlQ4tMjRK194h4j-0Z0DsGe2J82-SZXSFv3jQFAFCQb4oo2ytxCJFa4Wr4WvNiyefl15h2hzrl33KUG7RwgVgtkPr~7Whm2qLycoU9ZVb5jh4Ugd0yVgkIi1ENemotiQ__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ",
